    "ExplanationWrongB": "Governance objectives are not one of the three COSO internal control categories. While governance is related to the control environment (one of the five components, not a category of objectives), the three objective categories under COSO are operations, reporting, and compliance. The control environment provides the foundation for these three categories of objectives but is not itself a category of objectives.",
